  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0: Full RFC 9110/9112 compliance — 215/215 Http11Probe score (161 scored + 54 unscored, 0 FAIL, 0 WARN). Added pre-routing request validation (HTTP version gating, Host header enforcement, smuggling vector rejection, Range DoS protection). Added ETag generation and conditional request support (If-None-Match, If-Modified-Since, 304 Not Modified). Added lazy-parsed HttpRequest.Cookies property. Added chunked trailer field validation. Refactored EffinitiveServer into partial classes for maintainability. Added 80 new unit tests (142 total). InternalsVisibleTo for test project.",
